As you said, George Bailey meets Lloyd Dobbler, right?
就像你说的，乔治·贝利遇到了劳埃德·多布勒，对吧？

00:08:19.519 --> 00:08:30.759
He's this incredibly heart forward guy, romantically brave, sometimes insane, but like really goes for it.
他是一个内心极其坦荡的人，在浪漫上勇敢，有时甚至有点疯狂，但总是全力以赴。

00:08:30.759 --> 00:08:33.759
He's an incredible friend, he's resilient.
他是个极好的朋友，有着极强的韧性。

00:08:33.759 --> 00:08:36.919
He's got all these really admirable qualities.
他身上有所有这些非常令人钦佩的品质。

