00:09:37.039 --> 00:09:46.460
I was very excited about this because I was very excited to not play the kind of virtuous center of the story and be a little more to just scuff him up a little bit more.
我当时也很兴奋，因为我很高兴不用再扮演那种故事里品德高尚的核心人物，而是可以稍微放飞自我，让他身上多点烟火气。

00:09:46.460 --> 00:10:14.259
But I had said to you, and we've talked about this in podcast, but we never, I don't know if we'd confirmed it, but Pam told me that there was a note, a kind of gentle correction from the network, that they said there's a lot of Barney's on TV, there's only one Ted, meaning there's a lot of, not that there's a lot of Neil Patrick Harris is on TV, there's a lot of Lothario's on TV, but not a lot of guys who are this kind of guy who wants to be in a relationship and wants to settle down.
但我曾经对你说过，我们在播客里也讨论过这件事，虽然我不知道我们有没有确认过，但帕姆告诉我，当时电视台提了一条意见，一种善意的纠正，他们说电视上有很多巴尼那样的人，但只有一个泰德。这倒不是说电视上有许多尼尔·帕特里克·哈里斯，而是说电视上有很多花花公子，但像这种渴望进入恋爱关系、想要安顿下来的好男人却不多。

00:10:14.259 --> 00:10:22.179
