We'll find the weird corner and he will find the cool, interesting person hiding in the shadows.
我们会找到那个奇怪的角落，而他会找到那个藏在阴影里酷炫、有趣的人。

00:12:16.480 --> 00:12:18.480
And in this one, he's Kobarni.
但在这一集里，他成了巴尼。

00:12:18.480 --> 00:12:19.480
Exactly.
完全正确。

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:20.980
He's not looking for that person in the shadows.
他不再寻找阴影中的那个人。

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:21.980
He's at the center of the cat.
他成了全场的焦点。

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:24.539
He's not in the co-room, a co-check girl.
他不在衣帽间，不跟衣帽间女孩搭讪。

00:12:24.539 --> 00:12:40.299
He's seducing a married woman, he is absolutely drinking the Barney Kool-Aid, and he has a little bit on and off all season, and this is the episode where he goes too far.
他在勾引一个已婚妇女，他完全喝下了巴尼的那套歪理邪说，而且整个一季他都有点摇摆不定，这一集就是他做得太过分的一次。

00:12:40.299 --> 00:12:50.617
I mean, I'm glad it felt earned because we did have all these episodes in season three where like really crazy shit happened for Ted, why is he telling his children all this stuff.
我是说，我很高兴这一切感觉很真实，因为我们在第三季确实有这么多集，泰德发生了那么多疯狂的屁事，他为什么要跟他的孩子们讲这些。

00:12:50.617 --> 00:12:58.012
It's like, this is his cautionary tail phase where it's like, I went a little too free ranch here and I needed to be dialed back.
这就好像，这是他的警示故事阶段，就像是，我有点太无拘无束了，需要被拉回正轨。

00:12:58.012 --> 00:13:00.992
