特别感谢萨姆·西博尔德和埃利奥特·康纳斯。

00:58:11.840 --> 00:58:19.440
Go to HowWeMajorMother.com to learn more and click on the contact page to send us an email or a voice message.
访问 HowWeMajorMother.com 了解更多信息，并点击联系页面向我们发送电子邮件或语音留言。

00:58:19.440 --> 00:58:22.639
Your stories and questions are an important part of the show.
你的故事和问题是本节目的重要组成部分。

00:58:22.639 --> 00:58:30.119
Subscribe to Josh Radner's Muse Letters on Substack, and check out his music and everything else at joshradner.com.
欢迎在 Substack 上订阅乔什·拉德纳的 Muse Letters，并在 joshradner.com 上查看他的音乐及其他作品。

00:58:30.119 --> 00:58:39.730
Order Craig Thomas' debut novel, that's not how it happened, wherever books are sold, and read his other published writing at CraigThomasRider.com.
在各大图书销售渠道订购克雷格·托马斯的长篇小说处女作《事情可不是这样的》，并在 CraigThomasRider.com 上阅读他的其他出版作品。

00:58:39.730 --> 00:58:44.670
And you could subscribe to my own dead father's society on Substack.
你也可以在 Substack 上订阅我自己的“已故父亲协会”。

00:58:44.670 --> 00:58:51.909
To learn about how you make a difference, this shows ongoing campaign to raise funds for congenital heart disease research.
想要了解如何为本节目旨在为先天性心脏病研究筹集资金的长期活动贡献力量。

00:58:51.909 --> 00:58:56.440
Check out the Make a Difference tab at the top of our website.
请查看我们网站顶部的“Make a Difference”标签页。

00:58:56.440 --> 00:59:01.019
People will, in fact, dance.
人们事实上会跳舞的。

00:59:01.019 --> 00:59:09.179
Real question, it just hit me, am I, or just New York City.
真正的疑问，我突然想到的，是我，还是只有纽约市。
